Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.65,0:00:04.98,Italics,Blue,0,0,0,,Nu am multe amintiri despre tata din copilărie.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.35,Italics,Blue,0,0,0,,Tot ce-mi amintesc...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.68,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,Am câștigat.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.57,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,este că obișnuiam să jucăm des piatră, hârtie, foarfecă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.57,0:00:14.55,Flashback,Bl,0,0,0,,Nu e corect!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.55,0:00:16.72,Flashback,Bl,0,0,0,,Eu am apucat să mănânc doar două!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.30,0:00:19.55,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,Îmi spui că nu e corect să decidem prin piatră, hârtie, foarfecă?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.38,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,Sunt multe lucruri în lume care nu sunt corecte.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.79,0:00:27.58,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,Dar să le accepți pe toate asta înseamnă viața.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.94,0:00:31.48,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Nu am înțeles sensul cuvintelor pe care le-a folosit,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.48,0:00:33.40,Italics,,0,0,0,,sau ce încerca să spună.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.89,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Dar dintr-un motiv oarecare mi-am amintit.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.64,0:00:39.27,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,De parcă știa ce urma să se întâmple în viitor...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.94,0:02:15.99,Title,Bl,0,0,0,,Killer
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.09,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ai devenit mult mai bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.22,Main,T,0,0,0,,Presupun că, pentru că nu ai
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.22,0:02:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,preconcepții care să te împiedice, înveți repede.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.32,Main,T,0,0,0,,Poți deveni și mai puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.59,Main,T,0,0,0,,Pentru că ești un Killer.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.22,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Am auzit asta de multe ori de când am venit aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.23,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Dar ce este un „Killer”?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.81,0:02:52.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,Bine, îți voi spune.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.61,Main,T,0,0,0,,A existat cândva o națiune care a cucerit
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.61,0:02:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,cea mai mare parte a ținutului Consume.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,Marele Imperiu Atarika.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.91,Main,T,0,0,0,,Imperiul Atarika era pe punctul de a cuceri
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,continentul datorită dimensiunii copleșitoare a forțelor sale.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.70,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dar înainte să reușească, s-a destrămat.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.33,0:03:10.91,Main,T,0,0,0,,Pentru a-și extinde armatele,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.91,0:03:13.29,Main,,0,0,0,,recruta soldați de orice fel, indiferent cine erau.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.83,0:03:16.88,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dar pentru că aduceau și bandiți și huligani,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.88,0:03:21.76,Main,,0,0,0,,au scăzut calitatea trupelor și au pierdut încrederea oamenilor.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.76,0:03:24.68,Main,T,0,0,0,,În cele din urmă, o lovitură de stat i-a doborât.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.04,0:03:27.47,Main,T,0,0,0,,Acest colaps a devenit cunoscut drept Șocul Atarika.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.48,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Știu asta, dar ce legătură are cu „Killer”?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.19,Main,T,0,0,0,,Lasă-mă să termin.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.90,0:03:37.57,Main,T,0,0,0,,După Șocul Atarika, Consume a căzut în haos.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.19,0:03:40.78,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dar toate națiunile au evitat să
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,își mărească armatele fără rost,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.82,Main,T,0,0,0,,pentru a evita repetarea celor întâmplate cu Atarika.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.53,0:03:49.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,Creau soldați individuali puternici
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.45,0:03:51.16,Main,,0,0,0,,și îi puneau în echipe de elită.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Cu alte cuvinte, calitate în loc de cantitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,A fost creată o rasă de oameni cu o putere mai mare
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.71,0:04:00.01,Main,,0,0,0,,decât cea a oamenilor obișnuiți: Killerii.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.34,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Dar de ce sunt eu unul dintre ei?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.01,0:04:07.73,Main,T,0,0,0,,Poate că unul dintre strămoșii mamei sau tatălui tău a fost Killer?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.60,0:04:10.77,Main,T,0,0,0,,Din câte mi s-a spus, este genetic.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.02,0:04:13.39,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Familia mea...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.06,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Acum că mă gândesc, am auzit că mama
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.06,0:04:18.61,Main,,0,0,0,,și tata erau amândoi destul de puternici.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.53,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Poate că erau.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,Se spune că în zilele noastre războaiele
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.65,0:04:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,sunt decise de numărul de Killers dintr-o armată.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.28,Main,T,0,0,0,,Oricum, cam asta este.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.29,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Deci, practic, este doar o persoană foarte puternică?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.33,0:04:37.63,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Tejirof nu mi-a spus atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.80,Italics,T,0,0,0,,care era adevăratul înțeles al numelui „Killer”...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.21,0:04:42.38,Italics,,0,0,0,,sau cât de crud era.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,Hei, țâțe mari.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.64,0:04:51.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,Antrenamentul lui Gear este rezolvat pentru o vreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.52,Main,T,0,0,0,,Acum e rândul meu să te antrenez.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.27,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Singură cu el?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.40,0:04:57.77,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Nici vorbă.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:58.86,0:05:02.44,Main,R,0,0,0,,N-Nu am nimic de învățat de la tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.15,0:05:07.20,Main,T,0,0,0,,Lovitură bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.03,Main,R,0,0,0,,Vezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.03,0:05:09.78,Main,R,0,0,0,,Mă pricep perfect la arc, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.75,Main,T,0,0,0,,Arcul și săgeata sunt perfecte, da...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.33,Main,R,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.33,0:05:15.37,Main,R,0,0,0,,Spune-o direct.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.79,0:05:16.83,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.83,0:05:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Ai ochi bun și ești precisă la țintire.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.63,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dar cred că ești puțin deficitară ca luptătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.68,0:05:32.32,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dar pot să bag în gaura ta deschisă ceva mai bun decât o săgeată.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.72,0:05:34.68,Main,R,0,0,0,,Mai bun decât o săgeată?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:35.14,0:05:36.89,Main,T,0,0,0,,Tactici de atac la distanță.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.89,0:05:37.94,Main,T,0,0,0,,Shooting.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.94,Main,R,0,0,0,,Shooting?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.94,Main,T,0,0,0,,N-ai auzit niciodată de asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.19,Main,T,0,0,0,,Vai, vai...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.19,0:05:45.94,Main,,0,0,0,,armata Segua e plină de neexperimentați și virgine, hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.32,0:05:51.91,Main,T,0,0,0,,Fiecare Killer are un stil de luptă la care se pricepe cel mai bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.25,Main,T,0,0,0,,În cazul lui Gear, de exemplu,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.25,0:05:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,abilitatea de a transforma energia vitală în putere, Action.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.98,Main,T,0,0,0,,În cazul meu și al lui Ramses,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.98,0:06:04.17,Main,,0,0,0,,este Puzzle, abilitatea de a rearanja energia vitală în alte tipuri de energie.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.71,0:06:07.22,Main,T,0,0,0,,Iar al tău este Shooting.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.22,Main,T,0,0,0,,O metodă de luptă creată
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.22,0:06:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,de legendarul invadator al lui Consume, I. Vazer.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.43,0:06:15.81,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dacă o poți stăpâni,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:16.31,0:06:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,vei putea lupta de la distanță
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.77,0:06:21.19,Main,,0,0,0,,profitând în continuare de îndemânarea ta cu arcul.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.69,0:06:25.39,Main,T,0,0,0,,Îți voi arăta cum se face prima dată.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.99,0:06:29.24,Main,T,0,0,0,,O fată ca tine ar trebui să poată continua singură de aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.53,0:06:32.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,Concentrează-ți mintea asupra acestor trei degete.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu te relaxa până nu-ți spun eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.79,0:06:39.79,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.79,0:06:42.16,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Ceva se adună în degetele mele...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.75,0:06:44.00,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Degetele mele...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.46,Italics,,0,0,0,,o să explodeze!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.84,0:06:48.92,Main,R,0,0,0,,Hei... oprește-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.92,0:06:51.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,Încă nu. Îndură.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.47,Main,R,0,0,0,,Cât timp trebuie să îndur asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.06,0:06:55.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.43,0:06:57.47,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.48,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Nu mai pot să mă abțin!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.78,0:07:11.53,Main,T,0,0,0,,Aceasta este abilitatea de bază a Shooting-ului. „Shot”.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.16,0:07:16.29,Main,T,0,0,0,,În următoarele patru zile trebuie să înveți să o stăpânești.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.91,0:07:19.16,Main,R,0,0,0,,Patru zile, hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.16,0:07:21.25,Main,R,0,0,0,,Bine. O voi face.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.09,Main,R,0,0,0,,Înțeleg teoria.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.09,0:07:27.46,Main,R,0,0,0,,Acumulezi... și apoi tragi, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.92,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu te grăbi atât.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.72,Main,T,0,0,0,,Mai întâi exersează acumularea energiei...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.81,Main,R,0,0,0,,Încă nu pot controla puterea atât de bine pe cât aș vrea.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.85,Main,R,0,0,0,,Dar pot face asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.85,0:07:43.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,Dacă am patru zile.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.81,Main,N,0,0,0,,Uite-l!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.11,0:07:48.19,Main,N,0,0,0,,Aici erai, Tejirof-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.57,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ești sora mai mică a lui Gear, Nel-chan, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.20,Main,N,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.41,0:07:57.83,Main,N,0,0,0,,Ți-ai amintit de mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.20,0:08:00.33,Main,N,0,0,0,,Fratele meu te caută.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.67,Main,N,0,0,0,,Spune că vrea mai mult antrenament.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.67,0:08:05.50,Main,T,0,0,0,,Da, tocmai mergeam într-acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.50,0:08:07.25,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu mă grăbi.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.73,0:08:11.09,Main,T,0,0,0,,Sunt surprins că ai știut că sunt aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.67,0:08:13.88,Main,T,0,0,0,,Exercițiile de Shooting sunt periculoase,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.88,0:08:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,așa că am crezut că am ales un loc unde nu ar veni nimeni.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.01,0:08:22.35,Main,N,0,0,0,,Ăă, am crezut că îți aud vocea de aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.14,0:08:23.85,Main,T,0,0,0,,Vocea mea...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.81,0:08:28.98,Italics,T,0,0,0,,M-a găsit doar după voce?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.82,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Auzisem că atunci când satul Maxley a fost atacat,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.82,0:08:34.49,Italics,,0,0,0,,ea a supraviețuit, deși era doar un copil, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.07,0:08:37.12,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Oare puterea unui Killer
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.70,0:08:40.49,Italics,,0,0,0,,doarme și în ea?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.75,Main,T,0,0,0,,Hei, Urechi.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.00,0:08:46.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ce zici să-ți ajuți fratele?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.13,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,U-Uau...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.72,0:08:57.89,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,A reușit cu adevărat să evite toate săgețile de la distanța asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.14,0:09:02.90,Main,N,0,0,0,,Chiar am făcut eu asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.39,0:09:06.19,Main,T,0,0,0,,Da. Puterea ta era doar latentă.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.81,0:09:09.52,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu există nicio îndoială. Ești un Killer.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:17.78,0:09:20.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,Cum te simți după ce ți-ai trezit puterea?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.41,Main,N,0,0,0,,Uimitor...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.83,Main,N,0,0,0,,Pot vedea foarte departe.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.88,Main,N,0,0,0,,Pot auzi perfect, de asemenea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.46,Main,N,0,0,0,,Iar corpul meu poate simți chiar și cea mai ușoară adiere.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.63,0:09:33.71,Main,N,0,0,0,,Asta este
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.84,0:09:35.81,Main,,0,0,0,,puterea mea...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.05,Main,T,0,0,0,,Se pare că ai puterea
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.05,0:09:42.85,Main,,0,0,0,,de a-ți acorda simțurile la zona înconjurătoare: Online.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.48,Main,T,0,0,0,,Sunt sigur că va deveni ceva mai mult în viitor,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.48,0:09:48.44,Main,T,0,0,0,,dar chiar și acum, ai putea intra în luptă
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.86,Main,,0,0,0,,și ai fi foarte utilă.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:50.81,0:09:52.40,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu te voi forța.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.69,Main,T,0,0,0,,Decizia îți aparține.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.57,0:09:59.49,Main,N,0,0,0,,Luptă?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.03,0:10:00.99,Main,N,0,0,0,,Eu?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.20,0:10:02.99,Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Til...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.37,0:10:05.54,Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Frate...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.00,0:10:08.00,Main,N,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.33,0:10:11.00,Main,N,0,0,0,,O să... o să lupt și eu!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.42,0:10:13.96,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Deci toți patru sunt gata?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.42,0:10:16.09,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Asta e bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.84,0:10:19.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ramses, vreau să confirm ceva...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.47,Main,T,0,0,0,,Gear știe?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.93,0:10:25.98,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,De când l-am văzut prima dată, am crezut că ar putea fi așa...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.60,0:10:30.02,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Un supraviețuitor din Maxley și un Killer.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.56,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Iar când am văzut acea putere, am fost sigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.19,0:10:37.24,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Este fiul Generalului Alex.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.90,0:10:40.24,Main,T,0,0,0,,Și mergi mai departe cu acest plan crud?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.91,0:10:46.66,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Segua nu-și poate pierde toți generalii.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.10,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Te deranjează?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.25,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu. Deloc.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.67,0:10:54.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dacă sunt plătit, fac orice treabă, indiferent cât de murdară.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.55,0:10:56.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,Oricum sunt un tip murdar.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.92,0:11:00.00,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Ai grijă de Gear.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.19,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Hei, Tejirof.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.77,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Câți Killers există?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.27,0:11:17.94,Main,T,0,0,0,,Câți dintre ei?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.78,0:11:19.99,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.87,Main,T,0,0,0,,Poate sute?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.53,0:11:25.70,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Atunci spune-mi doar de cei puternici.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.70,0:11:28.20,Main,T,0,0,0,,Să vedem... cei puternici ar fi...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.08,0:11:33.21,Main,T,0,0,0,,Împăratul Imperiului Ninteldo, Killerul perfect: Marcus.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.58,0:11:34.96,Main,T,0,0,0,,Numărul doi al Ninteldo,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:35.46,0:11:38.17,Main,T,0,0,0,,geniul cunoscut drept „Omul care rezolvă toate misterele”:
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.17,0:11:39.21,Main,T,0,0,0,,Zelig.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Prințesa uneia dintre națiunile lor aliate,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.97,0:11:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Slovia, despre care se spune că are cea mai înaltă calitate din Consume: Crystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.68,0:11:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,CEO-ul Samurai al Republicii Havid: Kichou.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.06,0:11:55.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Artistul marțial neînvins al Federației Ganp: Tofig.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.94,0:11:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Și omul care este
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.40,0:12:01.36,Main,,0,0,0,,cunoscut drept singurul erou de pe continent,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Myomuto, din Republica Elil.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiar și Marcus a evitat să lupte cu el.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.78,0:12:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,De ei ar trebui să vă feriți.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.95,0:12:12.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Desigur, există Killers și în Tatoland, pe care îl atacăm mâine.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.58,0:12:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,D. Fisher, despre care se spune că este de trei ori mai mare decât un om obișnuit.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Cel mai tânăr dintre Frații blestemați, băutorul, Boys.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Cel mai în vârstă dintre Frații blestemați,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.51,Main,,0,0,0,,despre care se spune că este cel mai puternic din Tatoland, Bays.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.88,0:12:27.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Dar toți sunt oameni pe care va trebui să-i învingem.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.97,0:12:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă vrei să devii mai bun, desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.06,0:12:32.43,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Da, știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.52,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Va trebui să-i învingem.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.15,0:12:39.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,Uneori trebuie să sacrifici ceva pentru a deveni mai puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.65,0:12:42.28,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ești pregătit pentru asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.61,0:12:45.28,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Da. Încă vreau să devin mai puternică.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,Hei, puștiule.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.87,0:12:53.33,Main,T,0,0,0,,Când ți-ai dat seama că vrei să intri în armată?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.96,0:12:55.67,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Nu știu...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.67,0:12:58.08,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Poate pentru că tata era soldat?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.59,0:13:02.34,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Nu l-am mai văzut de când am mers în sat
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.34,0:13:04.55,Main,,0,0,0,,când aveam cinci ani, așa că nu-mi amintesc prea bine, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.93,0:13:09.56,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Îmi amintesc că l-am văzut învingând mulți soldați deodată în timpul meciurilor de antrenament.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.77,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Poate că, privindu-l,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.77,0:13:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,am decis să intru în armată.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.98,0:13:19.69,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,M-am gândit că, dacă intram, poate aș fi putut să-l văd.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.23,0:13:23.23,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Dar până acum nu am văzut pe nimeni care să semene cu el.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.41,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Mă întreb ce face acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.91,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Poate e mort.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.16,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.30,0:13:35.83,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ei bine... Poate dacă ești un băiat cuminte, vei ajunge să-l vezi.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.67,0:13:41.09,Main,T,0,0,0,,Obiectivul principal al operațiunii de azi
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.71,0:13:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,este să-l salvăm pe Generalul Alex, care este ținut într-o celulă subterană.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.34,0:13:50.43,Main,T,0,0,0,,În timp ce forța de diversiune atrage inamicul spre front,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.43,0:13:56.02,Main,T,0,0,0,,noi vom intra din spate și ne vom îndrepta direct spre celula lui.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.69,0:14:00.73,Main,T,0,0,0,,Vom evita să ieșim în evidență sau să intrăm în lupte inutile.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.73,0:14:06.03,Main,T,0,0,0,,Așa că Urechi își va folosi Online pentru a căuta capcane și inamici.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.03,0:14:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.78,0:14:09.07,Main,T,0,0,0,,Opal va trage de la distanță.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.07,0:14:09.74,Main,R,0,0,0,,Lasă pe mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.12,Main,T,0,0,0,,Iar dacă va fi nevoie de tine, Gear,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,vei străpunge apărarea cu viteza ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.95,0:14:15.79,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.37,0:14:19.71,Main,T,0,0,0,,Iar dacă lucrurile se înrăutățesc, rămâi calm.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.50,Main,T,0,0,0,,Mă ocup eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.26,0:14:26.59,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Înaintați!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.05,0:14:27.97,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Este armata Segua!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.01,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Armata Segua atacă!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.01,0:14:30.97,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Toată lumea la posturi!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.26,0:14:35.35,Main,N,0,0,0,,A început.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.77,0:14:36.73,Main,T,0,0,0,,Bine, să ne grăbim.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.89,0:14:38.98,Main,N,0,0,0,,Stați puțin, băieți.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.73,Main,N,0,0,0,,Este un seguian prăbușit acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.15,Main,T,0,0,0,,Cine?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.23,Main,T,0,0,0,,Un cercetaș?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.49,Main,R,0,0,0,,Ești unul dintre cercetași...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.04,0:14:58.21,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,I-am subestimat.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.91,0:15:00.12,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Aveți grijă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.46,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Așteaptă la poarta din spate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.09,0:15:05.11,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Cel mai puternic războinic din Tatoland.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.75,0:15:06.80,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Bays!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.34,Main,T,0,0,0,,Bays, hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.34,0:15:10.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Asta e o problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:11.09,0:15:12.61,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Sunt terminat.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.22,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,O să mor aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.76,0:15:17.98,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Dar... voi sunteți Killers, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.98,0:15:22.60,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Vă rog! Oricare dintre voi! Absoarbeți-mă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.61,0:15:27.11,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Vă rog... absorbiți-mă...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.78,Main,N,0,0,0,,Să te absorbim?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.32,0:15:31.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,Imposibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.95,0:15:36.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,Știi asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.16,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu ești suficient de puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.62,0:15:40.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Renunță.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.33,Main,T,0,0,0,,Te vom răzbuna, dacă nu altceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.67,Main,T,0,0,0,,Așa că odihnește-te în pace.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.13,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.22,0:15:56.01,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Aduceți victoria pentru Segua în locul meu...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.98,0:16:03.23,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Ce a vrut să spună prin „absorbiți”?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.81,0:16:04.90,Main,R,0,0,0,,Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.90,0:16:06.44,Main,R,0,0,0,,Încă nu știi, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.44,0:16:07.73,Main,R,0,0,0,,Presupun că n-aveai de unde să știi...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.65,0:16:12.45,Main,R,0,0,0,,Nu știi de ce ne numim „Killers”.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.95,0:16:16.12,Main,R,0,0,0,,Killerii sunt oameni care sunt puternici de la bun început,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,dar există o cale prin care pot deveni și mai puternici.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.79,0:16:20.75,Main,R,0,0,0,,Și este simplu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.25,0:16:24.96,Main,R,0,0,0,,Pur și simplu absorbi.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.50,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Absorb?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.50,0:16:27.46,Main,N,0,0,0,,Ce absorbi?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.63,Main,R,0,0,0,,Viețile altora.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.55,Main,R,0,0,0,,Absoarbe-le viețile și devino mai puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.05,0:16:35.89,Main,R,0,0,0,,De aceea ne numim „Killers”.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.47,Main,N,0,0,0,,Viețile oamenilor?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.02,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,N-Nu înțeleg...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.02,0:16:44.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Dar atunci, n-ar fi trebuit să-l absorbim pe el?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.11,0:16:50.48,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu este atât de simplu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.90,0:16:53.28,Main,T,0,0,0,,Există o limită a numărului de oameni pe care îi poate absorbi o singură persoană.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.07,0:16:58.53,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ai două semne, așa că poți absorbi doar doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.20,0:17:00.66,Main,T,0,0,0,,Există o limită,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.66,0:17:03.87,Main,,0,0,0,,așa că ar trebui să absorbi pe cineva doar când este mai eficient.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.08,Main,N,0,0,0,,Eficient?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.58,0:17:09.29,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Adică pe cineva mai puternic?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.01,0:17:15.01,Main,T,0,0,0,,Se pare că nu mai avem timp de vorbit.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.76,0:17:18.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,A venit la noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.47,0:17:21.43,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,El este?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.43,Main,T,0,0,0,,Da, exact.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.77,Main,T,0,0,0,,Acesta este cel mai puternic Killer din Tatoland,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.77,0:17:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Bays.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.27,0:17:29.44,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Da, am făcut-o.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.90,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,M-am plictisit.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.28,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că nu mă voi mai plictisi acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.32,0:17:37.13,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Tipul ăsta este cel mai puternic războinic din Tatoland, Bays?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.78,0:17:42.70,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Vreau să văd cât de departe mă poate duce puterea mea!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:42.75,0:17:44.20,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Bine, să facem asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.55,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Nu pot înainta...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.80,0:17:56.80,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Asta este o luptă adevărată?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.30,0:17:59.18,Main,T,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.55,0:18:01.81,Main,T,0,0,0,,Acum poți judeca astfel de lucruri.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.35,0:18:05.31,Main,T,0,0,0,,Faptul că îți poți da seama cât de puternic este înseamnă că evoluezi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.60,0:18:08.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dacă te-ai fi aruncat în luptă, ai fi murit.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.06,0:18:10.56,Main,T,0,0,0,,Este puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.86,0:18:13.03,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dacă am lupta serios cu el aici,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.03,0:18:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,am putea pierde doi dintre noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.15,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Doi?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.15,0:18:18.57,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Nu vrei să spui patru?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:19.24,0:18:20.20,Main,R,0,0,0,,Ce facem?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.20,0:18:23.24,Main,R,0,0,0,,Dacă pierdem timpul aici, operațiunea va eșua.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.24,0:18:24.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Foarte bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.29,0:18:26.10,Main,T,0,0,0,,Eu voi...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,îl voi opri aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.05,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Să mă oprești?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.92,0:18:37.88,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Tu?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.47,0:18:39.51,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Singur?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.22,0:18:41.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Da. Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.01,0:18:44.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău, din moment ce te-ai obosit să vii până aici...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.48,0:18:53.98,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dar vei dispărea de pe scenă aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.99,0:19:05.29,Main,T,0,0,0,,Acum, fugi.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hă?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.33,0:19:12.54,Main,T,0,0,0,,Un zid de lumină.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.92,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu te pot ataca din exterior,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.92,0:19:17.05,Main,,0,0,0,,dar nici tu nu-l poți ataca din interior.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.26,0:19:21.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Rămâi acolo și joacă-te singur o vreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.05,0:19:22.68,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ne mai vedem.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,Cum merge, Urechi?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.36,Main,N,0,0,0,,Echipa de diversiune funcționează.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.77,0:19:37.99,Main,N,0,0,0,,Nu sunt mulți inamici în fortăreață.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.86,0:19:42.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,Zidul de lumină care îl ține pe Bays va rezista cel mult douăzeci de minute.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.91,0:19:45.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,Dacă iese, avem o problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.33,0:19:48.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,Trebuie să continuăm înainte să se întâmple asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.54,Main,N,0,0,0,,Stați, băieți.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.83,Main,N,0,0,0,,Este o aură puternică în față.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.76,Main,N,0,0,0,,Este mare... ca un pește?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:57.76,0:19:58.76,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Un pește?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.76,0:20:00.97,Main,T,0,0,0,,Probabil D. Fisher.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.97,0:20:01.76,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Ce facem?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.64,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Să-l oprim cu un alt zid de lumină?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.39,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu, asta nu va mai fi posibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.06,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nu este ceva ce pot folosi atât de des.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.81,0:20:15.81,Main,T,0,0,0,,Este puțin riscant, dar va trebui să folosim o altă diversiune.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.98,0:20:18.03,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.03,0:20:19.53,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Atunci voi fi eu diversiunea.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.65,Main,S,0,0,0,,Nu te grăbi înainte, puștiule.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.15,0:20:25.82,Main,S,0,0,0,,Treaba ta este să distrugi ușile în timp ce diversiunea îl atrage departe.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.58,0:20:30.41,Main,S,0,0,0,,Și ai o sarcină mai importantă care urmează.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.08,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,O sarcină mai importantă?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.54,Main,T,0,0,0,,Deci, Opal, tu ești diversiunea.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.96,0:20:39.05,Main,R,0,0,0,,Bine, o voi face.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.55,0:20:42.76,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ca să fie clar, omul-pește este mai puternic decât tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Atrage-l departe și câștigă timp,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,apoi retrage-te când ai ocazia.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.81,Main,R,0,0,0,,Am înțeles!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,Nu avem timp, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.06,0:20:52.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,Să mergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.52,0:20:56.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,Îl voi {\i1}atrage{\i0} departe de voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.15,0:21:00.07,Main,R,0,0,0,,N-a fost amuzant?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.07,0:21:01.40,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Deloc.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.70,0:21:06.32,Main,F,0,0,0,,Tipii care luptă afară trebuie să se distreze.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.78,0:21:08.58,Main,F,0,0,0,,Vreau să pocnesc pe cineva.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:09.12,0:21:11.58,Main,F,0,0,0,,Sper să ajungă cineva până aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.69,0:21:23.00,Main,F,0,0,0,,Aici erai.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.64,0:21:31.14,Main,F,0,0,0,,Nu te mai mișca!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.48,Main,F,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.02,0:21:40.19,Italics,F,0,0,0,,Tejirof mi-a spus să mă retrag...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.63,0:21:43.19,Italics,F,0,0,0,,Dar îl voi învinge aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.90,0:21:58.83,Main,F,0,0,0,,Aceasta este închisoarea în care Generalul Alex este ținut captiv.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.22,0:22:00.78,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Generalul Alex.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.31,0:22:05.15,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Omul despre care se spune că este cel mai puternic din Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.96,0:22:08.34,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Mă întreb cum este.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.25,0:22:17.21,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Nu...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.59,0:22:18.35,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.28,0:22:21.11,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Tată?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:40.74,0:23:43.52,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,Pot să mă abțin mai bine decât oricine!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.98,0:23:44.88,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,Eram fericit...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.77,0:23:49.10,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,Pot face orice dacă vreau.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:49.52,0:23:51.82,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,Chiar și așa, voi continua să alerg,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.82,0:23:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,spre centrul lumii...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.82,0:23:54.90,Copy of Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,973)}Episode 3 is Being Worked On Right Now!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.65,0:00:04.98,Italics,Blue,0,0,0,,I don't have many memories \Nof my dad from when I was young.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.35,Italics,Blue,0,0,0,,All I remember...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.68,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,I win.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.57,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Is that we used to play \Nrock, paper, scissors a lot.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.57,0:00:14.55,Flashback,Bl,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.55,0:00:16.72,Flashback,Bl,0,0,0,,I only got to eat two!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.30,0:00:19.55,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,You're telling me it's not fair \Nto decide by rock, paper, scissors?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.38,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,There are lots of things in \Nthe world that aren't fair.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.79,0:00:27.58,Flashback,Dad,0,0,0,,But accepting them all is life.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.94,0:00:31.48,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,I didn't understand the \Nmeaning of the words he used,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.48,0:00:33.40,Italics,,0,0,0,,or what he was trying to say.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.89,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,But I remembered it for some reason.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.64,0:00:39.27,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Like he knew what was going \Nto happen in the future...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.94,0:02:15.99,Title,Bl,0,0,0,,Killer
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.09,Main,T,0,0,0,,You've gotten a lot better.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.22,Main,T,0,0,0,,I suppose since you don't have any
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.22,0:02:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,preconceptions getting in the \Nway, you're learning fast.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.32,Main,T,0,0,0,,You can still get stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.59,Main,T,0,0,0,,Because you're a Killer.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.22,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I've heard that a lot \Nsince I came here.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.23,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,But what's a "Killer"?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.81,0:02:52.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.61,Main,T,0,0,0,,There once was a nation that conquered
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.61,0:02:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,most of the land of Consume.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,The Great Atarika Empire.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.91,Main,T,0,0,0,,The Atarika Empire was on \Nthe verge of conquering
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,the continent with the overwhelming \Nsize of its forces.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.70,Main,T,0,0,0,,But before that could, it fell apart.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.33,0:03:10.91,Main,T,0,0,0,,In order to expand its armies,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.91,0:03:13.29,Main,,0,0,0,,it would gather soldiers of any \Nkind, no matter what they were.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.83,0:03:16.88,Main,T,0,0,0,,But because they brought in \Nbandits and thugs, as well,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.88,0:03:21.76,Main,,0,0,0,,it decreased the quality of their troops\Nand cost them the people's trust.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.76,0:03:24.68,Main,T,0,0,0,,In the end, a coup d'etat \Nbrought them down.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.04,0:03:27.47,Main,T,0,0,0,,This was crash was \Nknown as the Atarika Shock.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.48,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I know that, but what does\Nthat have to do with "Killer"?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.19,Main,T,0,0,0,,Let me finish.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.90,0:03:37.57,Main,T,0,0,0,,After the Atarika Shock, \NConsume fell into chaos.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.19,0:03:40.78,Main,T,0,0,0,,But all the nations \Navoided unnecessarily
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,increasing the size of their armies,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.82,Main,T,0,0,0,,in order to avoid a repeat \Nof what happened to Atarika.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.53,0:03:49.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,They would make strong \Nindividual soldiers
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.45,0:03:51.16,Main,,0,0,0,,and put them into elite squads.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,In other words, quality over quantity.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,A race of people with \Npower greater than that
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.71,0:04:00.01,Main,,0,0,0,,of normal humans were \Ncreated: the Killers.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.34,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,But why am I one?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.01,0:04:07.73,Main,T,0,0,0,,Perhaps one of your mom or dad's \Nancestors was a Killer?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.60,0:04:10.77,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'm told it's genetic.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.02,0:04:13.39,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,My family...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.06,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I heard my mom
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.06,0:04:18.61,Main,,0,0,0,,and dad were both pretty strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.53,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Maybe they were.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,They say wars these days
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.65,0:04:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,are decided by how many \NKillers are in an army.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.28,Main,T,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's basically it.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.29,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,So basically it's just \Na very strong person?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.33,0:04:37.63,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Tejirof didn't tell me at that time...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.80,Italics,T,0,0,0,,what the real meaning of \Nthe name "Killer" was...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.21,0:04:42.38,Italics,,0,0,0,,or how cruel it was.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Tits.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.64,0:04:51.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,Gear's training is taken \Ncare of for a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.52,Main,T,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to train you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.27,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Alone with him?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.40,0:04:57.77,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:58.86,0:05:02.44,Main,R,0,0,0,,I-I don't have anything \Nto learn from you.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.15,0:05:07.20,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nice shot.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.03,Main,R,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.03,0:05:09.78,Main,R,0,0,0,,My skill with a bow \Nis perfect, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.75,Main,T,0,0,0,,The bow and arrow's perfect, yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.33,Main,R,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.33,0:05:15.37,Main,R,0,0,0,,Come out and say it.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.79,0:05:16.83,Main,T,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.83,0:05:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You have a good eye and \Nyou're an accurate shot.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.63,Main,T,0,0,0,,But I think you're a little \Nlacking as a fighter.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.68,0:05:32.32,Main,T,0,0,0,,But I can put something better than \Nan arrow into your open hole.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.72,0:05:34.68,Main,R,0,0,0,,Better than an arrow?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:35.14,0:05:36.89,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ranged tactics.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.89,0:05:37.94,Main,T,0,0,0,,Shooting.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.94,Main,R,0,0,0,,Shooting?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.94,Main,T,0,0,0,,You've never heard of it?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.19,Main,T,0,0,0,,My my...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.19,0:05:45.94,Main,,0,0,0,,the Segua army's full of \Ncherries and virgins, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.32,0:05:51.91,Main,T,0,0,0,,Every Killer has a style of \Ncombat they're best with.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.25,Main,T,0,0,0,,In Gear's case, for example,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.25,0:05:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,the ability to change life \Nenergy into power, Action.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.98,Main,T,0,0,0,,In my and Ramses's case,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.98,0:06:04.17,Main,,0,0,0,,it's Puzzle, the ability to rearrange life \Nenergy into other kinds of energy.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.71,0:06:07.22,Main,T,0,0,0,,And yours is Shooting.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.22,Main,T,0,0,0,,A method of combat created
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.22,0:06:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,by the legendary invader \Nof Consume, I. Vazer.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.43,0:06:15.81,Main,T,0,0,0,,If you can master it,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:16.31,0:06:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to fight at long range
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.77,0:06:21.19,Main,,0,0,0,,while still taking advantage \Nof your skill with a bow.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.69,0:06:25.39,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'll show you how to \Ndo it the first time.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.99,0:06:29.24,Main,T,0,0,0,,A girl like you should be able \Nto take it the rest of the way.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.53,0:06:32.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,Concentrate your mind \Non these three fingers.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Don't relax until I tell you to.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.79,0:06:39.79,Italics,R,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.79,0:06:42.16,Italics,R,0,0,0,,Something's gathering in my fingers...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.75,0:06:44.00,Italics,R,0,0,0,,My fingers...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.46,Italics,,0,0,0,,are going to explode!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.84,0:06:48.92,Main,R,0,0,0,,Hey... stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.92,0:06:51.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,Not yet. Endure it.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.47,Main,R,0,0,0,,How long do I have to endure this?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.06,0:06:55.68,Main,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.43,0:06:57.47,Italics,R,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.48,Italics,R,0,0,0,,I can't hold it in anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.78,0:07:11.53,Main,T,0,0,0,,That's the basic skill \Nof Shooting. "Shot."
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.16,0:07:16.29,Main,T,0,0,0,,For the next four days you \Nneed to learn to master it.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.91,0:07:19.16,Main,R,0,0,0,,Four days, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.16,0:07:21.25,Main,R,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.09,Main,R,0,0,0,,I understand the theory.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.09,0:07:27.46,Main,R,0,0,0,,Hold... and then fire, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.92,Main,T,0,0,0,,Don't be in such a hurry.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.72,Main,T,0,0,0,,First practice gathering the energy...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.81,Main,R,0,0,0,,I can't control the power \Nas much as I'd like to yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.85,Main,R,0,0,0,,But I can do this.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.85,0:07:43.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,If I've got four days.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.81,Main,N,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.11,0:07:48.19,Main,N,0,0,0,,There you are, Tejirof-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.57,Main,T,0,0,0,,You're Gear's little sister, \NNel-chan, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.20,Main,N,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.41,0:07:57.83,Main,N,0,0,0,,You remembered me!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.20,0:08:00.33,Main,N,0,0,0,,My brother's looking for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.67,Main,N,0,0,0,,He says he wants more training.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.67,0:08:05.50,Main,T,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was just on my way.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.50,0:08:07.25,Main,T,0,0,0,,Don't rush me.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.73,0:08:11.09,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you knew \NI was here, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.67,0:08:13.88,Main,T,0,0,0,,Shooting practice is dangerous,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.88,0:08:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,so I'd thought I'd chosen a \Nplace where no one would come.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.01,0:08:22.35,Main,N,0,0,0,,Um, I thought I could hear \Nyour voice coming from here.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.14,0:08:23.85,Main,T,0,0,0,,My voice...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.81,0:08:28.98,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Did she find me just from my voice?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.82,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I'd heard that when Maxley \Nvillage was attacked,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.82,0:08:34.49,Italics,,0,0,0,,she survived, even though she \Nwas only a child, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.07,0:08:37.12,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Does the power of a Killer
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.70,0:08:40.49,Italics,,0,0,0,,sleep within her, too?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.75,Main,T,0,0,0,,Hey, Ears.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.00,0:08:46.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,How do you feel about \Nhelping your brother out?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.13,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,W-Wow...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.72,0:08:57.89,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,She was really able to dodge all \Nthose arrows at this range?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.14,0:09:02.90,Main,N,0,0,0,,Did I really do this?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.39,0:09:06.19,Main,T,0,0,0,,Yes. Your power was just dormant.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.81,0:09:09.52,Main,T,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it. \NYou're a Killer.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:17.78,0:09:20.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be awakened?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.41,Main,N,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.83,Main,N,0,0,0,,I can see far away.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.88,Main,N,0,0,0,,I can hear perfectly, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.46,Main,N,0,0,0,,And my body can feel even \Nthe slightest breeze.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.63,0:09:33.71,Main,N,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.84,0:09:35.81,Main,,0,0,0,,my...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.05,Main,T,0,0,0,,It seems you have the power
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.05,0:09:42.85,Main,,0,0,0,,to attune your senses to the \Nsurrounding area: Online.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.48,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll grow to be \Nsomething more in the future,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.48,0:09:48.44,Main,T,0,0,0,,but even now, you could go into combat
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.86,Main,,0,0,0,,and be very helpful.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:50.81,0:09:52.40,Main,T,0,0,0,,I won't force you.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.69,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'll leave the decision to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.57,0:09:59.49,Main,N,0,0,0,,Combat?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.03,0:10:00.99,Main,N,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.20,0:10:02.99,Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Til...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.37,0:10:05.54,Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.00,0:10:08.00,Main,N,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.33,0:10:11.00,Main,N,0,0,0,,I'll... I'll fight, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.42,0:10:13.96,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,So all four are ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.42,0:10:16.09,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.84,0:10:19.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ramses, I want to confirm something...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.47,Main,T,0,0,0,,Does Gear know?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.93,0:10:25.98,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Since I first saw him, \NI thought that might be the case...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.60,0:10:30.02,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,A survivor of Maxley, and a Killer.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.56,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,And when I saw that power, I was certain.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.19,0:10:37.24,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,He's the son of General Alex.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.90,0:10:40.24,Main,T,0,0,0,,And you're going through \Nwith this cruel plan?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.91,0:10:46.66,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Segua can't lose all of its generals.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.10,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Does it bother you?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.25,Main,T,0,0,0,,Nope. Not at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.67,0:10:54.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,If I get paid, I'll do any job, \Nno matter how dirty.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.55,0:10:56.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'm a dirty guy to begin with.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.92,0:11:00.00,Main,Ra,0,0,0,,Take care of Gear.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.19,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Hey, Tejirof.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.77,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,How many Killers are there?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.27,0:11:17.94,Main,T,0,0,0,,How many of them?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.78,0:11:19.99,Main,T,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.87,Main,T,0,0,0,,Maybe hundreds?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.53,0:11:25.70,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Then just tell me the strong ones.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.70,0:11:28.20,Main,T,0,0,0,,Let me see... the strong \Nones would be...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.08,0:11:33.21,Main,T,0,0,0,,The Emperor of the Ninteldo Empire, \Nthe perfect Killer: Marcus.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.58,0:11:34.96,Main,T,0,0,0,,Ninteldo's number two,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:35.46,0:11:38.17,Main,T,0,0,0,,the genius who's known as the \N"Man who solves all mysteries:"
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.17,0:11:39.21,Main,T,0,0,0,,Zelig.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The princess of one of \Ntheir allied nations,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.97,0:11:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Slovia, said to be of the highest \Nquality in Consume: Crystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.68,0:11:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The Samurai CEO of the \Nrepublic of Havid: Kichou.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.06,0:11:55.77,Main,,0,0,0,,The undefeated martial artist \Nof the Ganp Federation: Tofig.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.94,0:11:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,And the man who's
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.40,0:12:01.36,Main,,0,0,0,,known as the only hero \Non the continent,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Myomuto, of the Elil Republic.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Even Marcus avoided fighting him.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.78,0:12:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,They would be the ones to look out for.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.95,0:12:12.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, there are Killers in Tatoland, \Nwhich we're attacking tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.58,0:12:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,D. Fisher, said to be three times \Nthe size of an ordinary man.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The younger of the cursed \NBrothers, the drinker, Boys.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The older of the cursed Brothers,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.51,Main,,0,0,0,,said to be the strongest \Nin Tatoland, Bays.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.88,0:12:27.18,Main,,0,0,0,,But all of them are people \Nwe'll have to defeat.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.97,0:12:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to get better, that is.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.06,0:12:32.43,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.52,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,We'll have to defeat them.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.15,0:12:39.65,Main,T,0,0,0,,Sometimes you have to sacrifice \Nsomething to become stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.65,0:12:42.28,Main,T,0,0,0,,Are you prepared for that?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.61,0:12:45.28,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Yes. I still want to become stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.87,0:12:53.33,Main,T,0,0,0,,When did you realize you \Nwanted to join the military?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.96,0:12:55.67,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.67,0:12:58.08,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Maybe it was because \Nmy dad was a soldier?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.59,0:13:02.34,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him since \NI went to the village
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.34,0:13:04.55,Main,,0,0,0,,when I was five, so I don't \Nreally remember, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.93,0:13:09.56,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I do remember watching him defeat lots of \Nsoldiers at once during practice matches.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.77,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,It may have been watching that
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.77,0:13:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,when I decided to join the military.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.98,0:13:19.69,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I thought if I joined, \NI might be able to see him.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.23,0:13:23.23,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,But so far, I didn't see \Nanybody who looked like him.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.41,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's doing now.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.91,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Maybe he's dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.16,Main,T,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.30,0:13:35.83,Main,T,0,0,0,,Well... Maybe if you're a good boy, \Nyou'll get to see him.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.67,0:13:41.09,Main,T,0,0,0,,Our primary objective for today's operation
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.71,0:13:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,is to rescue General Alex, \Nwho's being held in an underground cell.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.34,0:13:50.43,Main,T,0,0,0,,While the decoy force draws \Nthe enemy towards the front,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.43,0:13:56.02,Main,T,0,0,0,,we'll go in from the back, \Nand head straight to his cell.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.69,0:14:00.73,Main,T,0,0,0,,We'll avoid standing out or getting \Ninto any unnecessary fights.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.73,0:14:06.03,Main,T,0,0,0,,So Ears will use her Online \Nto search for traps and enemies.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.03,0:14:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.78,0:14:09.07,Main,T,0,0,0,,Opal will snipe from far away.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.07,0:14:09.74,Main,R,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.12,Main,T,0,0,0,,And if we need you to, Gear,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,you'll break through with your speed.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.95,0:14:15.79,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.37,0:14:19.71,Main,T,0,0,0,,And if things get bad, \Njust remain calm.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.50,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.26,0:14:26.59,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.05,0:14:27.97,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,It's the Segua army!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.01,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,The Segua army is attacking!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.01,0:14:30.97,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Everybody to your posts!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.26,0:14:35.35,Main,N,0,0,0,,It's started.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.77,0:14:36.73,Main,T,0,0,0,,Okay, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.89,0:14:38.98,Main,N,0,0,0,,Hold up, guys.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.73,Main,N,0,0,0,,There's a Seguan who's \Ncollapsed over there.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.15,Main,T,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.23,Main,T,0,0,0,,A scout?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.49,Main,R,0,0,0,,You're one of the scouts...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.04,0:14:58.21,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,We underestimated them.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.91,0:15:00.12,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.46,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,He's waiting at the rear gate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.09,0:15:05.11,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,The strongest warrior of Tatoland.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.75,0:15:06.80,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Bays!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.34,Main,T,0,0,0,,Bays, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.34,0:15:10.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,That's a problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:11.09,0:15:12.61,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.22,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,I'm going to die here.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.76,0:15:17.98,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,But... you guys are Killers, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.98,0:15:22.60,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Please! Any of you! Absorb me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.61,0:15:27.11,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Please... absorb me...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.78,Main,N,0,0,0,,Absorb you?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.32,0:15:31.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.95,0:15:36.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.16,Main,T,0,0,0,,You're not powerful enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.62,0:15:40.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.33,Main,T,0,0,0,,We'll avenge you, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.67,Main,T,0,0,0,,So rest in peace.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.13,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.22,0:15:56.01,Main,Scout,0,0,0,,Bring victory to Segua for me...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.98,0:16:03.23,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,What did he mean by absorb?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.81,0:16:04.90,Main,R,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.90,0:16:06.44,Main,R,0,0,0,,You don't know yet, do you?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.44,0:16:07.73,Main,R,0,0,0,,I guess you wouldn't...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.65,0:16:12.45,Main,R,0,0,0,,You don't know why we're called "Killers."
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.95,0:16:16.12,Main,R,0,0,0,,Killers are people who \Nare strong to begin with,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,but there's a way for \Nthem to get stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.79,0:16:20.75,Main,R,0,0,0,,And it's easy.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.25,0:16:24.96,Main,R,0,0,0,,You simply absorb.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.50,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Absorb?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.50,0:16:27.46,Main,N,0,0,0,,Absorb what?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.63,Main,R,0,0,0,,Other's lives.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.55,Main,R,0,0,0,,Absorb their lives and become stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.05,0:16:35.89,Main,R,0,0,0,,That's why we're called "Killers."
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.47,Main,N,0,0,0,,People's lives?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.02,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,I-I don't understand...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.02,0:16:44.23,Main,,0,0,0,,But then, shouldn't we have absorbed his?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.11,0:16:50.48,Main,T,0,0,0,,It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.90,0:16:53.28,Main,T,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how many \None person can absorb.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.07,0:16:58.53,Main,T,0,0,0,,You have two marks, \Nso you can only absorb two.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.20,0:17:00.66,Main,T,0,0,0,,There's a limit,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.66,0:17:03.87,Main,,0,0,0,,so you should only absorb someone \Nwhen it's more effective.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.08,Main,N,0,0,0,,Effective?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.58,0:17:09.29,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,You mean someone stronger?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.01,0:17:15.01,Main,T,0,0,0,,Looks like we don't have time to talk.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.76,0:17:18.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,He's come to us.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.47,0:17:21.43,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,That's him?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.43,Main,T,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.77,Main,T,0,0,0,,That's the strongest Killer in Tatoland,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.77,0:17:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Bays.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.27,0:17:29.44,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.90,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,I was bored.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.28,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,I'm glad I won't be bored now.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.32,0:17:37.13,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,This guy is the strongest \Nwarrior in Tatoland, Bays?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.78,0:17:42.70,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,I want to see how far my \Nstrength can take me!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:42.75,0:17:44.20,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.55,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,I can't advance...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.80,0:17:56.80,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,This is a real fight?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.30,0:17:59.18,Main,T,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.55,0:18:01.81,Main,T,0,0,0,,You can judge these things now.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.35,0:18:05.31,Main,T,0,0,0,,The fact that you can tell how strong\Nhe is means you're growing.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.60,0:18:08.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,If you'd jumped in, you would've died.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.06,0:18:10.56,Main,T,0,0,0,,He's strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.86,0:18:13.03,Main,T,0,0,0,,If we were to seriously fight him here,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.03,0:18:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,we could lose two of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.15,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Two?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.15,0:18:18.57,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Don't you mean four?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:19.24,0:18:20.20,Main,R,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.20,0:18:23.24,Main,R,0,0,0,,If we waste time here, \Nthe operation will fail.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.24,0:18:24.58,Main,T,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.29,0:18:26.10,Main,T,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,stop him here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.05,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Stop me?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.92,0:18:37.88,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.47,0:18:39.51,Main,Ba,0,0,0,,Alone?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.22,0:18:41.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.01,0:18:44.14,Main,T,0,0,0,,Sorry, since you took the \Ntrouble to come here...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.48,0:18:53.98,Main,T,0,0,0,,But you're going to vanish \Nfrom the stage here.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.99,0:19:05.29,Main,T,0,0,0,,Now, run.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.33,0:19:12.54,Main,T,0,0,0,,A wall of light.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.92,Main,T,0,0,0,,I can't attack you from the outside,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.92,0:19:17.05,Main,,0,0,0,,but you can't attack it \Nfrom the inside, either.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.26,0:19:21.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Stay there and play with \Nyourself for a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.05,0:19:22.68,Main,T,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.35,Main,T,0,0,0,,How's it going, Ears?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.36,Main,N,0,0,0,,The decoy squad is working.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.77,0:19:37.99,Main,N,0,0,0,,There aren't many enemies \Nwithin the fortress.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.86,0:19:42.41,Main,T,0,0,0,,The wall of light holding Bays \Nwill last twenty minutes at best.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.91,0:19:45.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,If he gets out we have a problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.33,0:19:48.45,Main,T,0,0,0,,We need to keep going before that happens.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.54,Main,N,0,0,0,,Wait, guys.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.83,Main,N,0,0,0,,There's a strong aura up ahead.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.76,Main,N,0,0,0,,He's big... like a fish?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:57.76,0:19:58.76,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,A fish?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.76,0:20:00.97,Main,T,0,0,0,,Probably D. Fisher.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.97,0:20:01.76,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.64,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Stop him with another wall of light?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.39,Main,T,0,0,0,,No, that won't be possible anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.06,Main,T,0,0,0,,It's not something I can use that often.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.81,0:20:15.81,Main,T,0,0,0,,It's a bit risky, but we'll \Nhave to use another decoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.98,0:20:18.03,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.03,0:20:19.53,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Then I'll be the decoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.65,Main,S,0,0,0,,Don't rush ahead, kid.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.15,0:20:25.82,Main,S,0,0,0,,Your job's to destroy the doors \Nwhile the decoy draws him off.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.58,0:20:30.41,Main,S,0,0,0,,And you've got a bigger job coming up.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.08,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,A bigger job?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.54,Main,T,0,0,0,,So, Opal, you're the decoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.96,0:20:39.05,Main,R,0,0,0,,All right, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.55,0:20:42.76,Main,T,0,0,0,,Just so we're clear, the fish \Nman is stronger than you.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.51,Main,T,0,0,0,,Draw him off and buy time,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,then withdraw when you have a chance.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.81,Main,R,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,There's no time, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.06,0:20:52.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.52,0:20:56.06,Main,R,0,0,0,,I'll {\i1}lure{\i0} him away from you guys.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.15,0:21:00.07,Main,R,0,0,0,,Wasn't that funny?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.07,0:21:01.40,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.70,0:21:06.32,Main,F,0,0,0,,The guys fighting outside \Nmust be having fun.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.78,0:21:08.58,Main,F,0,0,0,,I want to smash somebody.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:09.12,0:21:11.58,Main,F,0,0,0,,I hope somebody gets this far.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.69,0:21:23.00,Main,F,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.64,0:21:31.14,Main,F,0,0,0,,Stop moving around!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.48,Main,F,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.02,0:21:40.19,Italics,F,0,0,0,,Tejirof told me to pull back...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.63,0:21:43.19,Italics,F,0,0,0,,But I'll defeat him here!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.90,0:21:58.83,Main,F,0,0,0,,This is the prison where General \NAlex is being held captive.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.22,0:22:00.78,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,General Alex.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.31,0:22:05.15,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,The man who's said to be \Nthe strongest in Segua.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.96,0:22:08.34,Italics,Bl,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's like.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.25,0:22:17.21,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.59,0:22:18.35,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.28,0:22:21.11,Main,Bl,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:40.74,0:23:43.52,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,I can hold it in better than anybody!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.98,0:23:44.88,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,I was happy...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.77,0:23:49.10,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,I can do anything, if I want.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:49.52,0:23:51.82,Main,Preview,0,0,0,,Even so, I'm going to keep running,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.82,0:23:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,towards the center of the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:57.90,Copy of Title,,0,0,0,,
